        "correct": true,
        "why": "Right: once per day."
      },
      {
        "text": "Reads the CSV again",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "The data is in memory."
      },
      {
        "text": "Computes a different median",
        "correct": false,
        "why": "`equals` said they match."
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "id": "ex-jby9w6bf",
    "version": 1,
    "section": "the-slow-path-in-groupby",
    "type": "quiz",
    "difficulty": "hard",
    "drillable": true,
    "prompt": "The cost of a `lambda` in `agg` grows with what?",
    "hint": "By station it was a couple of milliseconds.",
    "choices": [
      {
